Branch=stable

[Flatpak Preinstall https://flathub.org/apps/org.inkscape.Inkscape]
Branch=stable

[Flatpak Preinstall https://flathub.org/apps/org.libreoffice.LibreOffice]
Branch=stable

[Flatpak Preinstall https://flathub.org/apps/org.kde.okular]
Branch=stable

[Flatpak Preinstall https://flathub.org/apps/org.onlyoffice.desktopeditors]
Branch=stable

[Flatpak Preinstall https://flathub.org/apps/com.protonvpn.www]
Branch=stable

[Flatpak Preinstall https://flathub.org/apps/org.rncbc.qpwgraph]
Branch=stable

[Flatpak Preinstall https://flathub.org/apps/com.rawtherapee.RawTherapee]
Branch=stable

